 AWS Cloud Engineer (2 to 5 Years Experience) – Interview Preparation

In 2025, companies are hiring strong AWS Cloud Engineers who can:

 Design scalable architecture
 Optimize cost & performance
 Automate deployments
 Ensure security & monitoring

If you’re preparing for interviews, practice these real-world questions 👇👇

 Interview Questions
 How do you design a highly available application architecture using AWS?

 Explain the difference between NLB, ALB, and CLB. When will you use each?

 What is the purpose of VPC Peering vs Transit Gateway?

 How do you secure S3 buckets? Mention best practices.

 Explain how Auto Scaling works. What policies have you used?

 Difference between EC2 On-Demand, Reserved, and Spot Instances?

 How do you create a multi-AZ setup for RDS?

 What is the difference between AWS Systems Manager Parameter Store vs Secrets Manager?

 Explain the flow of request from Internet → VPC → Private Subnet.

 What is IAM role vs IAM policy vs IAM user?

 What is the use of Lifecycle Policies in S3?

 How do you troubleshoot performance issues in EC2?

 Explain Blue/Green Deployment on AWS.

 What is CloudFormation and how have you used it?

 Steps to implement Disaster Recovery (DR) strategy in AWS.

 Difference between Stateful and Stateless Architecture.

 What are Security Groups vs NACLs? When do you use each?

 What is the role of CloudWatch, CloudTrail, GuardDuty?

 Explain PrivateLink, Endpoint, NAT Gateway.

 How do you optimize AWS cost for large workloads?

 Your application is facing latency issues across regions. How will you design a solution using Global Accelerator or Route53?

 You need to migrate a large monolithic application to microservices on AWS. What architecture and services will you use?

 Your S3 storage bill increased suddenly. How will you investigate and reduce cost?

 A customer wants zero downtime deployment. Explain how you will design using CodeDeploy, ECS, Blue/Green.

 You receive an alert: CPU of EC2 is 90%+ for 10 minutes. What steps will you take to identify and fix the issue?

 Design a multi-region failover strategy for a business-critical application.

 How will you secure a publicly accessible API using WAF, API Gateway, Cognito, and Shield?

 Your RDS instance is hitting connection limits. How will you scale and optimize?

 Your application needs to process 1 million messages/hour. How will you design using SQS/SNS/Kinesis?

 Project requires infrastructure as code. Which tool will you choose: CloudFormation or Terraform and why?

 You need to rotate secrets automatically. How will you implement using Secrets Manager?

 Your EC2 instances are under DDoS attack. How will you mitigate?
